## CORE TABLES NEXUS MUST USE

### 1. GPSS OPPORTUNITIES (63 Fields)
**Purpose:** Central opportunity tracking  
**NEXUS Usage:**
- CREATE: New opportunities auto-logged here
- READ: Status checks, pipeline views, scoring history
- UPDATE: Stage progression, status changes, deadline tracking

**Key Fields NEXUS Uses:**
```
Name                    → Opportunity title
AGENCY NAME             → Full agency name
RFP NUMBER              → Solicitation number
Deadline                → Response deadline
VALUE                   → Contract value estimate
SOURCE                  → SAM.gov, State Portal, Direct
Source Status           → Stage tracking ("Stage 2: Intelligence Complete")
Set-Aside Type          → EDWOSB, WOSB, SB, etc.
NAISC Codes             → Industry codes
State / City            → Performance location
Priority                → High/Medium/Low
Win Probability         → AI-calculated 0-100%
AI Recommendation       → "BID NOW (85/100)" or tier
STATUS                  → Active, Won, Lost, Withdrawn
Pipeline Stage          → Sales funnel stage
Assigned to             → Owner
Notes                   → Full description, intelligence
CONTRACTING OFFICER     → CO email/contact
Source URL              → Link to SAM.gov/opportunity
Opportunity Category    → Forecast type
AI Qualification Result → Full AI analysis
AI Strengths            → Why this is a match
AI Concerns             → Risk factors
```

**Views NEXUS Maintains:**
- All Opportunities
- 🔴 BID NOW (Score 75+, Stage 0-4)
- 🟡 WORTH A LOOK (Score 55-74)
- ⏰ This Week's Deadlines
- 📊 Stage 2: Intelligence In Progress
- 👥 Stage 3: Resourcing (Need Subs)
- 📝 Stage 4: Development (Proposals)
- 📤 Stage 5: Submitted (Awaiting Award)
- ✅ Recently Won
- ❌ Recently Lost

