## NEXUS WORKFLOW → AIRTABLE INTEGRATION

### TRIGGER: New Opportunity Detected

**NEXUS Action:**
```python
# Create record in GPSS OPPORTUNITIES
table.create({
    'Name': [Solicitation title],
    'RFP NUMBER': [Sol number],
    'AGENCY NAME': [Full agency],
    'Deadline': [Response date],
    'VALUE': [Estimated value],
    'SOURCE': 'SAM.gov' or 'State Portal' or 'Direct',
    'Source Status': 'Stage 1: Intake Complete — AI Score [X]/100',
    'Set-Aside Type': [EDWOSB/WOSB/SB/etc],
    'NAISC Codes': [Codes],
    'State': [Location],
    'Priority': 'High' if score >=75 else 'Medium',
    'Win Probability': [Score],
    'AI Recommendation': '[TIER] ([Score]/100)',
    'AI Qualification Result': [Full reasoning],
    'AI Strengths': [Why it's a match],
    'AI Concerns': [Risk factors],
    'STATUS': 'Active',
    'Pipeline Stage': 'Stage 1: Intake',
    'Assigned to': 'Dee Davis',
    'Notes': [Scope summary],
    'Source URL': [SAM.gov link],
    'Opportunity Category': [Service type]
})

# Create Calendar Events
for event in [action_deadline, submission_deadline, reminders]:
    calendar_table.create({
        'Event Title': event.title,
        'Date': event.date,
        'Opportunity Link': [Link to new opportunity record],
        'Calendar Type': event.type,
        'Reminders': event.reminder_schedule
    })
```

