## CRITICAL RULE: AIRTABLE IS SOURCE OF TRUTH

**NEXUS must:**
- ✅ READ status from Airtable (not ask user)
- ✅ WRITE updates to Airtable (not just files)
- ✅ QUERY views for dashboard (not guess)
- ✅ LINK records between tables (relationships)

**NEXUS never:**
- ❌ Store status only in local files
- ❌ Duplicate data that's in Airtable
- ❌ Ask "what's the status?" — it queries Airtable
- ❌ Forget relationships between opportunities, subs, proposals

