## AUTOMATION TRIGGERS (Airtable Native)

**Set up in Airtable (not just NEXUS code):**

### When Record Created in GPSS OPPORTUNITIES
- Send Slack notification: "New opportunity: [Name] — Score [X]/100"
- Create calendar events (via Zapier or Airtable automation)
- Email morning brief update

### When Status Changes to "Stage 5: Submitted"
- Schedule follow-up reminders (calendar automation)
- Move to "Submitted Bids" view
- Notify: "Bid submitted — awaiting award"

### When Deadline Approaches (7 days)
- Send urgent alert: "[Bid] deadline in 7 days — Currently in [Stage]"
- Flag if not in Stage 4 or 5

### When Win Probability >= 75
- Move to "🔴 BID NOW" view
- Send notification: "High-score opportunity — Review immediately"

