## FILE SYSTEM ↔ AIRTABLE SYNC

**Bid Folder Documents → Airtable Links:**

| File in Folder | Airtable Record |
|----------------|-----------------|
| `SEND_TO_BUYER/Capability_Statement.html` | GPSS PROPOSALS → Cap Statement Link |
| `SEND_TO_BUYER/Quote_Response.html` | GPSS PROPOSALS → Proposal Document |
| `WORKFLOW_CHECKLIST.md` | GPSS OPPORTUNITIES → Checklist Status (parsed) |
| `PRICING_WORKSHEET.md` | GPSS PROPOSALS → Pricing - Breakdown |
| `SUBCONTRACTOR_VETTING.md` | GPSS SUBCONTRACTORS → Vetting Notes |
| `INCUMBENT_INTELLIGENCE.md` | GPSS OPPORTUNITIES → Notes (appended) |

**Sync Rule:**
- Documents are source in folders (full content)
- Airtable contains links and status (not full text)
- NEXUS updates both when documents change

